                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.17.0"&gt;3.17.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Add support for AWS SDK v4.0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Fix resource-based sampling for ASP.NET spans in IIS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Automatically disable Kafka header injection for unsupported brokers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Fixes for Impacted Tests and Attempt To Fix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ASM/IAST] Improve sampling behaviour for vulnerability detection and schema extraction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add support for AWS SDK v4.0 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3043421402" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6929" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6929/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6929"&gt;#6929&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Fix resource-based sampling for &lt;code&gt;ASP.NET&lt;/code&gt; spans in IIS (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3046862955" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6936" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6936/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6936"&gt;#6936&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix: change &lt;code&gt;cmd.component&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;component&lt;/code&gt; for process spans (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3062530934" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6969" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6969/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6969"&gt;#6969&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;CI Visibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Add missing provider's environment variables. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3056304242" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6956" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6956/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6956"&gt;#6956&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Attempt to fix from v2 to v4 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3058302547" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6963" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6963/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6963"&gt;#6963&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[dd-trace] Improved GAC commands (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3080167633" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6995" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6995/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6995"&gt;#6995&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix exit code from &lt;code&gt;GacUninstallCommand&lt;/code&gt; when the assembly is not in the GAC (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3086894986" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7003" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7003/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7003"&gt;#7003&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ASM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ASM] Disabled sampling in API Sec schema extractor in Standalone mode (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3056452908" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6957" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6957/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6957"&gt;#6957&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[IAST] New sampling mechanism (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3062902914" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6971" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6971/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6971"&gt;#6971&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Continuous Profiler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Provide exact minor.build version information for .NET Framework applications (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3063515216" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6974" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6974/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6974"&gt;#6974&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Refactor sample transformation (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3065254717" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6975" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6975/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6975"&gt;#6975&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Dynamic Instrumentation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Dynamic Instrumentation] DEBUG-3796 Fix rate limiting for probes that don't have limit (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3035487239" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6921" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6921/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6921"&gt;#6921&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
