&lt;li&gt;Disable Kafka header injection when brokers return unknown error (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3049220060" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6945" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6945/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6945"&gt;#6945&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
